# remains hand-written in spheres_incanter.lst.
Sphere Specialization (Alteration)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Alteration) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Alteration Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ALTERATION|1	DESC:Gain the Alteration sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Alteration sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Alteration Bioreaver [EO3].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Sphere Specialization (Alteration) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Alteration)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Alteration Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ALTERATION|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Alteration sphere: you instead gain one Alteration talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Alteration Bioreaver [EO3].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Active Sphere Specialization (Alteration)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Alteration)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Alteration) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Alteration Battleshaping|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Alteration Change Shape|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Alteration Shapeshifter’s Renewal|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Incanter Alteration Battleshaping	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Battleshaping [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter may grant himself or a creature under the effects of his shapeshift one trait as a swift action. This trait cannot cost a spell point and must be one that he can grant through his shapeshift. This trait lasts for 1 round per 2 incanter levels and if the target so chooses they may resist this effect without the need for a saving throw. This trait stacks with polymorph effects, including shapeshift. At 11th level, the incanter can grant two traits in this fashion. A target can only be under the effects of one use of battleshaping at any time. The incanter can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Incanter Alteration Change Shape	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Change Shape [Sp]: At 8th level, once per day as a free action the incanter can grant himself one Alteration talent he does not possess for a number of rounds equal to his incanter level. Every time this ability is used, he may change this bonus talent to another Alteration talent he does not possess. He may use this ability an additional time per day for every 6 levels beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Incanter Alteration Shapeshifter’s Renewal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Shapeshifter’s Renewal [Su]: At 20th level, whenever the incanter places a shapeshift on a target and spends a spell point to maintain it without concentration, he may choose to remove any poison and non-magical disease from the target and heal the target 2 hit points per incanter level. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc20
Sphere Specialization (Bear)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Bear) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Bear Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_BEAR|1	DESC:Gain the Bear sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Bear sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Sphere Specialization (Bear) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Bear)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Bear Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_BEAR|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Bear sphere: you instead gain one Bear talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Active Sphere Specialization (Bear)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Bear)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Bear) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Bear Bear Companion|Incanter Bear Bear Speech|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Bear Divine Bear|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Incanter Bear Bear Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Bear Companion [Su]: You gain an animal companion, as the druid class feature, treating your incanter levels as druid levels for this purpose. This companion must be a bear, and begins with an Intelligence of 6. Begins at Incanter level 1.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Incanter Bear Bear Speech	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Bear Speech [Ex]: You may speak and understand the language of bears, and wild bears begin with an attitude of neutral towards you instead of unfriendly. Begins at Incanter level 1.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Incanter Bear Divine Bear	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Divine Bear: At 8th level, you gain the ability to, once per day as a full-round action, magically call your bear to your side. This ability is the equivalent of a sphere effect. You may use this ability once per day at 8th level, plus an additional time per day for every 4 levels thereafter, for a total of four times per day at 20th level. At 11th level, the bear gains the advanced creature template. At 15th level, the bear gains spell resistance equal to your incanter level + 11. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc22
Sphere Specialization (Blood)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Blood) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Blood Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_BLOOD|1	DESC:Gain the Blood sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Blood sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Sphere Specialization (Blood) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Blood)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Blood Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_BLOOD|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Blood sphere: you instead gain one Blood talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Active Sphere Specialization (Blood)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Blood)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Blood) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Blood Red Minion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Blood Hemorrhagic Aura|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Blood Hemorrhagic Mastery|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Incanter Blood Red Minion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Red Minion [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains a Tiny blood construct as a permanent servant. As the incanter gains levels, he may choose to increase the size of the construct based on the following table, changeable when the incanter gains a level. The incanter may choose to advance the blood construct’s Hit Dice to that of an available size without actually increasing its size, if he so chooses. / Incanter Level / Construct / 3rd / Small / 6th / Medium / 9th / Large / 12th / Huge / 15th / Gargantuan / 18th / Colossal A slain blood construct may be replaced with an 8 hour ritual and sufficient blood to create a construct of that size [see the Extract Blood Construct talent]. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Incanter Blood Hemorrhagic Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Hemorrhagic Aura [Su]: At 8th level, as a free action the incanter can emit a 30-foot aura that intensifies any bleed effects for one round. He may emit this aura for a total number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. Hostile creatures within this area that are suffering from ongoing bleed effects must attempt a Fortitude save each round or suffer 1d2 points of Constitution damage that round. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Incanter Blood Hemorrhagic Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Hemorrhagic Mastery [Su]: At 20th level, any bleed damage the incanter deals is increased by 1/2 his incanter level. This bonus bleed damage is not increased by Empower Spell or similar effects. Additionally, whenever he uses blood control, he can roll twice to penetrate a creature’s spell resistance and take the better result. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc23
Sphere Specialization (Conjuration)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Conjuration) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Conjuration Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_CONJURATION|1	DESC:Gain the Conjuration sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Conjuration sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Sphere Specialization (Conjuration) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Conjuration)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Conjuration Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_CONJURATION|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Conjuration sphere: you instead gain one Conjuration talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Active Sphere Specialization (Conjuration)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Conjuration)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Conjuration) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Conjuration Summoner’s Charm|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Conjuration Aura of Banishment|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Conjuration Mirrored Summoning|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Incanter Conjuration Summoner’s Charm	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Summoner’s Charm [Su]: At 3rd level, whenever the incanter summons a companion from the Conjuration sphere and maintain its presence through concentration, the companion remains for a number of rounds after he ceases concentrating equal to 1/2 his incanter level [minimum 1] before disappearing. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Incanter Conjuration Aura of Banishment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Aura of Banishment [Su]: At 8th level, as a free action the incanter can emit a 30-foot aura of banishment for one round. He may emit this aura for a total number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Any summoned or called creature in the area [except those he specifies] must attempt a Will save each round. Once the creature fails a Will saving throw, it is staggered as long as it remains inside the aura. If it fails a second Will saving throw, it is immediately sent back to its home plane and the spell or effect that summoned it immediately ends. If that spell or effect summoned more than one creature, only the creature that failed its saving throws is affected. If the summoned creature was a companion, it cannot be summoned again for 1 minute. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Incanter Conjuration Mirrored Summoning	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Mirrored Summoning: At 20th level, once per day when the incanter summons a companion, he may summon a duplicate of that companion with the same action. He must spend all required spell points to summon this duplicate companion, just as with the original. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc24
Sphere Specialization (Creation)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Creation) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Creation Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_CREATION|1	DESC:Gain the Creation sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Creation sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc25
