Active Sphere Specialization (Creation)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Creation)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Creation) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Creation Creator’s Focus|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Creation Master of Creation|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Creation Unbreakable|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc25
Incanter Creation Creator’s Focus	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Creator’s Focus [Su]: At 3rd level, whenever the incanter maintains an object he has created with the Creation sphere through concentration, that object remains a number of additional rounds equal to 1/2 his incanter level [minimum 1 round] after he ceases concentrating before disappearing. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc25
Incanter Creation Master of Creation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Master of Creation [Sp]: At 8th level, whenever the incanter creates an object with the Creation sphere, the cost of creating the object is reduced by 1 spell point [minimum 0]. Only one such object can be created with master of creation at a time; if another object is created using master of creation, any previous objects created with master of creation are immediately dismissed. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc25
Incanter Creation Unbreakable	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Unbreakable [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter gains a +2 natural armor bonus. All of his worn equipment and any object he creates gain a +10 bonus to its hardness. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc25
Sphere Specialization (Dark)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Dark) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Dark Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_DARK|1	DESC:Gain the Dark sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Dark sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc26
