Active Sphere Specialization (Dark)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Dark)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Dark) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Dark Home in the Dark|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Dark Shadow Step|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Dark Shadow Renewal|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc26
Incanter Dark Home in the Dark	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Home in the Dark [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains blindsense 10 feet when within an area of dim light or darkness. This bonus increases by 5 feet per 5 incanter levels he possesses, to a maximum of 30 feet at 20th level. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc26
Incanter Dark Shadow Step	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Shadow Step [Sp]: At 8th level, the incanter can use this ability to walk through the Plane of Shadow and reappear as a standard action. He can travel up to 30 feet per incanter level per day in this fashion, either in a single round or broken up across multiple shadow steps. This movement must be used in 5 feet increments and does not provoke an attack of opportunity. Travel through the Shadow Plane is imprecise; when he arrives, he re-enters 1 square off target, as per the rules for thrown splash weapons. If this would place him in an occupied square, he instead arrives in the nearest safe location. When he arrives, he is cloaked in shadow and gain concealment for 1 round. He may bring other willing creatures with him, but he must expend an equal amount of distance for each additional creature brought with him. They likewise re-enter off target [roll location for each creature] and are cloaked in shadow for 1 round. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc26
Incanter Dark Shadow Renewal	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Shadow Renewal: At 20th level, the incanter gains fast healing 5 while in dim light or darkness. This fast healing is suppressed while in any level of illumination brighter than dim light. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc26
Sphere Specialization (Death)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Death) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Death Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_DEATH|1	DESC:Gain the Death sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Death sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Death Guide of the Dead [Gravecaller's HB].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Sphere Specialization (Death) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Death)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Death Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_DEATH|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Death sphere: you instead gain one Death talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Death Guide of the Dead [Gravecaller's HB].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Active Sphere Specialization (Death)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Death)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Death) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Death Power over Undead|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Death Bolster|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Death Spirit Touch|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Incanter Death Power over Undead	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Power over Undead [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter receives Command Undead or Turn Undead as a bonus feat. He can channel energy a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier, but only to use the selected feat. He can take other feats to add to this ability, such as Extra Channel and Improved Channel, but not feats that alter this ability, such as Elemental Channel and Alignment Channel. The DC to save against these feats is equal to 10 + 1/2 his incanter level + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Incanter Death Bolster	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Bolster [Sp]: At 8th level, the incanter can touch an undead creature as a standard action and infuse it with negative energy. It gains a +2 profane bonus on all attack rolls, damage rolls, and saving throws, as well as 2 temporary hit point per Hit Die and a +4 bonus to its channel resistance. These bonuses last for a number of rounds equal to the incanter’s casting ability modifier [minimum 1]. The bonuses and temporary hit points are immediately dispelled if the creature is within the area of a consecrate spell or a Hallowed Totem. He can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Incanter Death Spirit Touch	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Spirit Touch [Sp]: At 20th level, the incanter can touch incorporeal creatures as if his body, natural weapons, and wielded weapons were all under the effects of the ghost touch weapon special ability. He may activate or suppress this ability as a free action, and while this ability is active, he is immune to the touch attacks of shadows, ghosts, and other incorporeal creatures. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc27
Sphere Specialization (Divination)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Divination) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Divination Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_DIVINATION|1	DESC:Gain the Divination sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Divination sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Divination Precognition [SM—]; Divination Recollection [SM—]; Divination Tactician.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Sphere Specialization (Divination) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Divination)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Divination Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_DIVINATION|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Divination sphere: you instead gain one Divination talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Divination Precognition [SM—]; Divination Recollection [SM—]; Divination Tactician.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Active Sphere Specialization (Divination)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Divination)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Divination) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Divination Forewarned|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Divination Foretell|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Divination Perfect Knowledge|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Incanter Divination Forewarned	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Forewarned [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter can always act in the surprise round even if he fails to attempt a Perception roll to notice a foe, but he is still considered flat-footed until he takes an action. In addition, he receives a bonus on initiative checks equal to 1/2 his incanter level [minimum +1]. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Incanter Divination Foretell	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Foretell [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter can utter a prediction of the immediate future as a free action. For one round, he emits a 30-foot aura of fortune that aids his allies or hinders his enemies, as chosen by him at the time of prediction. If he chooses to aid, he and his allies gain a +2 luck bonus on ability checks, attack rolls, magic skill checks, saving throws, and skill checks. If he chooses to hinder, his enemies take a –2 penalty on those rolls instead. He can use this ability for a number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Incanter Divination Perfect Knowledge	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Perfect Knowledge: At 20th level, anytime the incanter would roll for initiative or a Knowledge check, instead assume the roll would have resulted in a natural 20. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc31
Sphere Specialization (Enhancement)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Enhancement) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Enhancement Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ENHANCEMENT|1	DESC:Gain the Enhancement sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Enhancement sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Sphere Specialization (Enhancement) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Enhancement)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Enhancement Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ENHANCEMENT|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Enhancement sphere: you instead gain one Enhancement talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Active Sphere Specialization (Enhancement)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Enhancement)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Enhancement) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Enhancement Physical Enhancement|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Enhancement Perfection Of Self|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Enhancement Permanent Enhancement|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Incanter Enhancement Physical Enhancement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Physical Enhancement: At 3rd level, the incanter gains a +1 bonus to one physical ability score [Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution]. This bonus increases by +1 for every five incanter levels he possesses. He can change this bonus to a new ability score when he rests to regain spell points. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Incanter Enhancement Perfection Of Self	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Perfection Of Self [Su]: At 8th level, as a free action the incanter can grant himself an enhancement bonus to a single ability score equal to 1/2 his incanter level for one round. He may use this ability for a number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Incanter Enhancement Permanent Enhancement	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Permanent Enhancement [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter can make one enhancement permanent. He can have no more than one enhancement made permanent in this way at one time. If he designates another enhancement as permanent, the previous permanent enhancement ends. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc35
Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Fallen Fey Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_FALLENFEY|1	DESC:Gain the Fallen Fey sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Fallen Fey sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Fallen Fey Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_FALLENFEY|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Fallen Fey sphere: you instead gain one Fallen Fey talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Active Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fallen Fey) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fallen Fey Fey Nature|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fallen Fey Resist Fey Lures|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fallen Fey Fey-Touched|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Incanter Fallen Fey Fey Nature	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fey Nature [Ex]: At 3rd level, while under the effects of his fey-link the incanter gains DR/cold iron and an insight bonus to attack rolls made with natural weapons granted by the Fallen Fey sphere equal to half his class level. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Incanter Fallen Fey Resist Fey Lures	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Resist Fey Lures [Ex]: At 8th level, the incanter may roll twice and take the better result on saves against mind-affecting abilities originating from creatures of the fey type. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Incanter Fallen Fey Fey-Touched	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Fey-Touched [Ex]: At 20th level, the incanter is treated as a fey rather than as a humanoid [or whatever his creature type was] for the purpose of spells and magical effects. He is always considered under the effects of a fey-link, though fey-blessings still only last for the usual duration of a fey-link when activated. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc36
Sphere Specialization (Fate)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fate) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Fate Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_FATE|1	DESC:Gain the Fate sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Fate sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Sphere Specialization (Fate) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fate)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Fate Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_FATE|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Fate sphere: you instead gain one Fate talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Active Sphere Specialization (Fate)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fate)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Fate) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fate Prescience|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fate Tugging Strands|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Fate Fated Protection|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Incanter Fate Prescience	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Prescience [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter may, at the beginning of his turn, spend a free action to roll a single d20. At any point before his next turn, he may use the result of this roll as the result of any d20 roll he is required to make. If he does not use the d20 result before his next turn, it is lost. He can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Incanter Fate Tugging Strands	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Tugging Strands [Su]: At 8th level, as a non-action the incanter can force a creature within line of sight to reroll any one roll that it has just made before the result of the roll is revealed. The result of the reroll must be taken, even if it is worse than the original roll. He can use this ability once per day at 8th level, and one additional time per day for every 6 levels beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Incanter Fate Fated Protection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Fated Protection [Su]: At 20th level, whenever he would be affected by a sphere effect, spell, or spell-like ability that allows a saving throw, he can roll twice to save against the effect and take the better result. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc37
Sphere Specialization (Illusion)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Illusion) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Illusion Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ILLUSION|1	DESC:Gain the Illusion sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Illusion sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Sphere Specialization (Illusion) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Illusion)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Illusion Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_ILLUSION|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Illusion sphere: you instead gain one Illusion talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Active Sphere Specialization (Illusion)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Illusion)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Illusion) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Illusion Extended Illusions|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Illusion Bedeviling Aura|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Illusion Permanent Illusion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Incanter Illusion Extended Illusions	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Extended Illusions [Su]: At 3rd level, any illusion the incanter creates and maintains through concentration lasts a number of additional rounds equal to 1/2 his incanter level after he stops maintaining concentration [minimum +1]. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Incanter Illusion Bedeviling Aura	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Bedeviling Aura [Su]: At 8th level, as a standard action you can emit a 30-foot aura that bedevils your enemies with phantasmal assailants. Enemies within this aura move at half speed, are unable to take attacks of opportunity, and are considered to be flanked. This is a mind-affecting effect. Maintaining this effect is a free action, and you can use this ability for a number of rounds per day equal to your incanter level. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Incanter Illusion Permanent Illusion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Permanent Illusion: At 20th level, the incanter can make one illusion permanent. He can have no more than one illusion made permanent in this way at one time. If he designates another illusion as permanent, the previous permanent illusion ends. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc38
Sphere Specialization (Life)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Life) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Life Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_LIFE|1	DESC:Gain the Life sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Life sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Sphere Specialization (Life) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Life)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Life Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_LIFE|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Life sphere: you instead gain one Life talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Active Sphere Specialization (Life)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Life)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Life) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Life Bolstering Essence|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Life Life Sight|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Life Life Essence|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Incanter Life Bolstering Essence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Bolstering Essence [Sp]: At 3rd level, the incanter may grant himself temporary hit points equal to his incanter level as a free action. These hit points last for 1 round. He can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Incanter Life Life Sight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Life Sight [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter can give himself blindsight to a range of 10 feet as a free action for 1 round. He may use this ability a number of times per day equal to his incanter level. This ability only allows him to detect living creatures and undead creatures. This sight also tells him whether a creature is living or undead. Constructs and other creatures that are neither living nor undead cannot be seen with this ability. The range of this ability increases by 10 feet at 12th level, and by an additional 10 feet for every four levels beyond 12th. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Incanter Life Life Essence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Life Essence [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter becomes immune to death effects and gains fast healing 1. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc39
Sphere Specialization (Light)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Light) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Light Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_LIGHT|1	DESC:Gain the Light sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Light sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Sphere Specialization (Light) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Light)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Light Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_LIGHT|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Light sphere: you instead gain one Light talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Active Sphere Specialization (Light)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Light)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Light) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Light Lighteyes|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Light Disappearance|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Light See All|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Incanter Light Lighteyes	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Lighteyes [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains Perception as a class skill and he gains an insight bonus equal to 1/2 his incanter level on all Perception checks. This bonus increases to being equal to his incanter level when detecting invisible or incorporeal creatures. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Incanter Light Disappearance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Disappearance [Sp]: At 8th level, the incanter may bend light around himself, giving himself the invisible condition as a swift action. The incanter may use this ability for a total number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level, and these rounds do not need to be consecutive. Ending this invisibility is a free action. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Incanter Light See All	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:See All: At 20th level, the incanter can see perfectly in darkness of any kind, even magical darkness that normally impedes darkvision. The target may see all invisible and ethereal creatures as if they were normally visible. Such creatures are visible to you as translucent shapes, allowing you easily to discern the difference between visible, invisible, and ethereal creatures. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc40
Sphere Specialization (Mana)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mana) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Mana Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_MANA|1	DESC:Gain the Mana sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Mana sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Sphere Specialization (Mana) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mana)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Mana Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_MANA|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Mana sphere: you instead gain one Mana talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Active Sphere Specialization (Mana)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mana)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mana) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mana Mana Master|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mana Reinforce Magic|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mana Impossible Magic|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Incanter Mana Mana Master	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Mana Master: The incanter’s mastery over magic is unmatched by any other. At 3rd level, he gains a +2 bonus on all Spellcraft and Knowledge [arcana] checks, increasing by +1 at 7th level and every 4 levels thereafter. Additionally, he gains a +1 bonus to all magic skill checks, and his magic skill defense. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Incanter Mana Reinforce Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Reinforce Magic: At 8th level when an ally within close range of the incanter casts or attempts to dispel a sphere effect, as a free action that may be taken outside of his turn he may reinforce that magical effect. This grants the ally the benefits of his mana master ability, but only for that specific use of the sphere effect. Additionally, the bonus to magic skill checks and his magic skill defense from his mana master ability increases by 1 at 8th level and every 8 levels thereafter. He may use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Incanter Mana Impossible Magic	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Impossible Magic: The incanter’s magic will forever be unimpeded, and his mastery of antimagic provides him with a defense against it. At 20th level, when the incanter casts a sphere effect, he may spend up to 10 additional spell points when casting it to reinforce the sphere effect. The sphere effect is unimpeded by any attempt to counterspell it [which fails automatically] and penetrates any antimagic effects originating from creatures with a magic skill bonus lower than twice the amount of additional spell points used to reinforce the sphere effect. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc41
Sphere Specialization (Mind)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mind) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Mind Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_MIND|1	DESC:Gain the Mind sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Mind sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Sphere Specialization (Mind) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mind)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Mind Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_MIND|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Mind sphere: you instead gain one Mind talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Active Sphere Specialization (Mind)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mind)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Mind) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mind Enchanting Smile|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mind Aura of Despair|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Mind Reflective Mind|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Incanter Mind Enchanting Smile	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Enchanting Smile [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains Bluff, Diplomacy, and Intimidate as class skills and gains a +2 insight bonus to checks with those skills. This bonus increases by +1 for every five incanter levels he possesses, up to a maximum of +6 at 20th level. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Incanter Mind Aura of Despair	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Aura of Despair [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter can spend a free action to emit a 30-foot aura of despair for one round, for a maximum number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. Enemies within this aura take a –2 penalty on ability checks, attack rolls, damage rolls, saving throws, and skill checks. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. This is a mind-affecting effect. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Incanter Mind Reflective Mind	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Reflective Mind: At 20th level, whenever the incanter succeeds at a saving throw against a mind-affecting effect, a spell of the enchantment school, or an effect from the Mind sphere, that spell or effect does not affect him and is instead reflected back at its caster, treating the incanter as if they had cast the spell [such as for the purpose of charm or domination effects]. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc42
Sphere Specialization (Nature)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Nature) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Nature Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_NATURE|1	DESC:Gain the Nature sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Nature sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Nature Aeromancer (air) [EO3]; Nature Ferromancer (metal) [EO3]; Nature Hydromancer (water) [EO3]; Nature Phytomancer (plant) [EO3]; Nature Pyromancer (fire) [EO3]; Nature Terramancer (earth) [EO3].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Sphere Specialization (Nature) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Nature)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Nature Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_NATURE|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Nature sphere: you instead gain one Nature talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Nature Aeromancer (air) [EO3]; Nature Ferromancer (metal) [EO3]; Nature Hydromancer (water) [EO3]; Nature Phytomancer (plant) [EO3]; Nature Pyromancer (fire) [EO3]; Nature Terramancer (earth) [EO3].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Active Sphere Specialization (Nature)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Nature)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Nature) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Nature Animal Companion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Nature Empower Companion|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Nature Life Connection|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Incanter Nature Animal Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Animal Companion [Ex]: Beginning at 3rd level, the incanter gains an animal companion, as the druid class feature, treating his incanter levels as druid levels for this purpose. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Incanter Nature Empower Companion	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Empower Companion [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter may touch an animal to infuse it with power. The animal immediately gains the advanced creature simple template: it gains a +2 bonus on all rolls, including damage rolls and special ability DCs, a +4 bonus to AC and CMD, and +2 hit points per Hit Die. This lasts for a number of rounds equal to his casting ability modifier. During this time, the animal’s primal instincts take hold for the duration of this spell—if the animal knows tricks granted by the Handle Animal skill, it loses access to all of those tricks save for “attack.” Animals that already have the advanced creature template are unaffected by this ability. He may use this ability once per day, plus an additional time per day for every 6 levels beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Incanter Nature Life Connection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Life Connection: At 20th level, the incanter may transfer up to half of any hit point damage dealt to himself to his animal companion. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc43
Sphere Specialization (Protection)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Protection) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Protection Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_PROTECTION|1	DESC:Gain the Protection sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Protection sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Protection Lattice Weaver.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Sphere Specialization (Protection) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Protection)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Protection Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_PROTECTION|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Protection sphere: you instead gain one Protection talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Protection Lattice Weaver.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Active Sphere Specialization (Protection)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Protection)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Protection) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Protection Resistance|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Protection Energy Absorption|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Protection Protected Life|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Incanter Protection Resistance	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Resistance [Ex]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains resistance equal to his incanter level to an energy type of his choice, chosen when he rests to regain spell points. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Incanter Protection Energy Absorption	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Energy Absorption [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter gains an amount of energy absorption equal to 3 times his incanter level per day. Whenever he takes energy damage, apply immunity, vulnerability [if any], and resistance first and apply the rest to this absorption, reducing his daily total by that amount. Any damage in excess of his absorption is applied to him normally. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Incanter Protection Protected Life	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Protected Life [Su]: At 20th level, the first time each day that the incanter would be reduced to 0 or fewer hit points by damage, he is instead reduced to 1. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc50
Sphere Specialization (Technomancy)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Technomancy) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Technomancy Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TECHNOMANCY|1	DESC:Gain the Technomancy sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Technomancy sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Technomancy Energy [LG].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Sphere Specialization (Technomancy) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Technomancy)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Technomancy Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TECHNOMANCY|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Technomancy sphere: you instead gain one Technomancy talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Technomancy Energy [LG].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Active Sphere Specialization (Technomancy)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Technomancy)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Technomancy) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Technomancy Source|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Technomancy Extended Sprite|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Technomancy Warning Sprite|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Technomancy Permanent Sprite|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Incanter Technomancy Source	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Source: Arcforge Players Compendium Begins at Incanter level 1.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Incanter Technomancy Extended Sprite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Extended Sprite [Su]: At 3rd level, any sprite the incanter creates and maintains through concentration lasts a number of additional rounds equal to 1/2 his incanter level after he stops maintaining concentration [minimum 1]. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Incanter Technomancy Warning Sprite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Warning Sprite [Su]: At 8th level, the incanter gains a +2 insight bonus to AC against attacks made by any creature or any weapon that is a host for his sprites. This bonus increases by 1 at 14th level and every 6 levels thereafter. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Incanter Technomancy Permanent Sprite	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Permanent Sprite [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter can make one sprite permanent. He can have no more than one sprite made permanent in this way at one time. If he designates another sprite as permanent, the previous permanent sprite ends. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc52
Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Telekinesis Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TELEKINESIS|1	DESC:Gain the Telekinesis sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Telekinesis sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Telekinesis Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TELEKINESIS|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Telekinesis sphere: you instead gain one Telekinesis talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Active Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Telekinesis) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Telekinesis Telekinetic Impediment|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Telekinesis Great Flight|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Telekinesis Telekinetic Stability|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Incanter Telekinesis Telekinetic Impediment	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Telekinetic Impediment [Sp]: At 3rd level, the incanter may spend an immediate action to attempt to impede an attack made against a creature within 30 feet of him, including himself. He must declare he is using this ability before the attack roll is made. The attack suffers a -1 penalty, -1 per 5 incanter levels he possesses. He may use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Incanter Telekinesis Great Flight	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Great Flight [Su]: Starting at 8th level, as a free action the incanter may grant himself a fly speed of 50 feet with perfect maneuverability for a number of minutes per day equal to his incanter level. This duration does not need to be consecutive, but it must be used in 1 minute increments. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Incanter Telekinesis Telekinetic Stability	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Telekinetic Stability [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter gains a circumstance bonus equal to his incanter level to Fly checks, Acrobatics checks, and his CMD. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc54
Sphere Specialization (Time)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Time) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Time Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TIME|1	DESC:Gain the Time sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Time sphere. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Time Acceleration [SM—].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Sphere Specialization (Time) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Time)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Time Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_TIME|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Time sphere: you instead gain one Time talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities. Sub-specializations trade abilities: Time Acceleration [SM—].	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Active Sphere Specialization (Time)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Time)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Time) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Time Fast|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Time Retry|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Time Twist Time|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Incanter Time Fast	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Fast [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter gains a +10 feet bonus to his base movement speed, +5 feet for every 5 incanter levels he possesses. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Incanter Time Retry	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Retry [Su]: At 8th level, as a non-action the incanter may force a target within 30 feet of him to reroll a dice roll they just made, taking the second result regardless of whether it is worse or better. He must decide to use this ability after the roll is made but before the results are revealed. He may use this ability once per day at 8th level, plus an additional time for every 6 levels beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Incanter Time Twist Time	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Twist Time [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter gains two swift actions per turn instead of one. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc55
Sphere Specialization (War)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (War) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|War Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WAR|1	DESC:Gain the War sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the War sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Sphere Specialization (War) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (War)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter War Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WAR|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the War sphere: you instead gain one War talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Active Sphere Specialization (War)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (War)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (War) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter War Seize the Initiative|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter War Cooperative Defense|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter War War Mage|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Incanter War Seize the Initiative	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Seize the Initiative [Su]: At 3rd level, whenever the incanter and his allies roll for initiative, he can grant one ally within 30 feet the ability to roll twice and take either result. This decision is made before the initiative roll is made. He can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Incanter War Cooperative Defense	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Cooperative Defense: At 8th level, whenever a spell or effect targets the incanter and one or more allies within 30 feet, he can use this ability to allow his allies to use his saving throw against the effect in place of their own. Each ally must make this choice individually before the rolls are made. Using this ability is an immediate action. He can use this ability once per day at 8th level, and one additional time per day for every four incanter levels beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Incanter War War Mage	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:War Mage [Ex]: At 20th level, the incanter and all allies within 60 feet gain a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls and damage rolls. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc57
Sphere Specialization (Warp)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Warp) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Warp Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WARP|1	DESC:Gain the Warp sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Warp sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Sphere Specialization (Warp) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Warp)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Warp Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WARP|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Warp sphere: you instead gain one Warp talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Active Sphere Specialization (Warp)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Warp)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Warp) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Warp Shift|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Warp Dimensional Lord|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Warp Warp Mastery|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Incanter Warp Shift	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Shift [Su]: At 3rd level, the incanter can teleport to a nearby space as a swift action. This movement does not provoke an attack of opportunity. He must be able to see the space that he is moving into. He cannot take other creatures with him when he uses this ability [except for familiars]. He can move 5 feet for every two incanter levels he possesses [minimum 5 feet]. He can use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his casting ability modifier. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Incanter Warp Dimensional Lord	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpellLike	DESC:Dimensional Lord [Sp]: At 8th level, whenever a creature attempts to use a teleportation effect or summon a creature within 30 feet of him, the incanter may attempt to block the effect by attempting a magic skill check as an immediate action. If the check succeeds, the effect or spell fails and is wasted; otherwise, it is unaffected. He can use this ability once per day plus one additional time for every 6 incanter levels he possesses beyond 8th. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Incanter Warp Warp Mastery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Warp Mastery [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter quadruples the distance he may teleport. This also affects his shift power, and he may use shift as a free action. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc58
Sphere Specialization (Weather)	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Weather) - Already Known	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	ABILITY:Spheres Magic Talent|AUTOMATIC|Weather Sphere	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WEATHER|1	DESC:Gain the Weather sphere as a bonus sphere and +1 caster level with it; its specialization abilities come into effect in specialization order, gated by level. Select the "- Already Known" record instead if you already possess the Weather sphere.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
Sphere Specialization (Weather) - Already Known	CATEGORY:Incanter Specialization	TYPE:IncanterSpecialization	COST:3	PREVAREQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,1	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Weather)	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_INCANTER_SPECIALIZATION_POINTS|3	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Incanter Weather Specialization Talent|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_CL_WEATHER|1	DESC:Take this only if you already possess the Weather sphere: you instead gain one Weather talent of your choice, plus +1 caster level with that sphere and its specialization abilities.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
Active Sphere Specialization (Weather)	CATEGORY:Incanter Active Specialization	TYPE:IncanterActive	COST:2	PREMULT:1,[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Weather)],[PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Incanter Specialization,Sphere Specialization (Weather) - Already Known]	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Weather Weatherworn|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,3	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Weather Cyclone|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Incanter Weather Cloak of the Elements|PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_INCANTER_LEVEL,20	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
Incanter Weather Weatherworn	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Extraordinary	DESC:Weatherworn [Ex]: At 3rd level, the incanter can treat the effects of any weather as being 1 step lesser in severity for himself. This improves to 2 steps at 12th level, and 3 steps at 20th level. Begins at Incanter level 3.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
Incanter Weather Cyclone	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Cyclone: At 8th level, the incanter can create a vortex of turbulent wind around himself as a standard action. This vortex has a radius of up to 10 feet and a maximum height of 10 feet per incanter level. Any ranged attack passing through this vortex automatically misses. Any flying creature moving through the vortex must make a Fly skill check or immediately fall from the sky, taking falling damage [the creature cannot make a Fly check to reduce or negate this damage]. Creatures on the ground cannot pass through the vortex without first making a Strength check. The DC of this check is equal to 10 + the incanter’s MSB. The vortex is faintly visible and can be spotted with a DC 15 Perception skill check. Maintaining this ability is a free action and the incanter can use this ability for a number of rounds per day equal to his incanter level. These rounds do not need to be consecutive. Begins at Incanter level 8.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
Incanter Weather Cloak of the Elements	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:Supernatural	DESC:Cloak of the Elements [Su]: At 20th level, the incanter is protected from weather and elements, taking only half damage from all sources of acid, cold, electricity, fire, and sonic damage. Begins at Incanter level 20.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/incanter#toc59
